event: user
data: {"session_id":"94434218-446d-460c-8050-b257e08c50b6","seq":139,"kind":"user","payload":{"text":"Write a one-page memo summarising the numbers as /workspace/memo.docx, and also give me a PDF copy."},"at":1793934214500}

id: 140
event: status
data: {"session_id":"94434218-446d-460c-8050-b257e08c50b6","seq":140,"kind":"status","payload":{"status":"running"},"at":1793934214502}

id: 141
event: tool_call
data: {"session_id":"94434218-446d-460c-8050-b257e08c50b6","seq":141,"kind":"tool_call","payload":{"call":{"command":"cd /workspace && cat > memo.md <<'EOF'\n# MEMO\n\n**To:** Leadership Team  \n**From:** Analytics  \n**Date:** 2025-11-06  \n**Re:** Revenue by Region — Summary\n\n## Overview\n\nCurrent revenue by region totals **465k USD** across four regions. The East region leads at **140k (30.1%)**, followed by North at **120k (25.8%)**, West at **110k (23.7%)**, and South at **95k (20.4%)**.\n\n## Key Points\n\n- **East is the top performer** at 140k, 20k above the regional average of ~116k.\n- **South lags** at 95k, roughly 32% below East; it is the clear priority for growth initiatives.\n- North and West sit close to the average, contributing a combined 230k (49.5%) of total revenue.\n- The spread between the highest and lowest region is 45k, indicating moderate but meaningful regional disparity.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nReplicate East's successful sales practices in South and West, targeting South to close at least half of its 45k gap to East in the next period. A chart of revenue by region is attached (revenue.png).\nEOF\npandoc memo.md -o memo.docx && pandoc memo.md -o memo.pdf && ls -l memo.docx memo.pdf","tool":"bash"},"tool":"bash"},"at":1793934215912}

id: 142
event: tool_result
data: {"session_id":"94434218-446d-460c-8050-b257e08c50b6","seq":142,"kind":"tool_result","payload":{"ok":false,"output":"exit code 47\nstderr:\npdflatex not found. Please select a different --pdf-engine or install pdflatex -- see also /usr/share/doc/pandoc/README.Debian\n","tool":"bash","truncated":false},"at":1793934217583}

id: 143
event: tool_call
data: {"session_id":"94434218-446d-460c-8050-b257e08c50b6","seq":143,"kind":"tool_call","payload":{"call":{"command":"cd /workspace && pandoc memo.md -o memo.docx && pandoc memo.md --pdf-engine=weasyprint -o memo.pdf 2>/dev/null || pandoc memo.md --pdf-engine=wkhtmltopdf -o memo.pdf 2>/dev/null || (libreoffice --headless --convert-to pdf memo.docx >/dev/null 2>&1); ls -l memo.docx memo.pdf","timeout_seconds":120,"tool":"bash"},"tool":"bash"},"at":1793934218355}

